{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6d18adfa-4c52-8372-9afa-13fa0dbee0c7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T12:00:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tito Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning, well, just about afternoon. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a pothole that blew out my tire. Tito Gomes. Third time I've seen that hole get bigger and nobody's touched it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Where's the pothole, Mr. Gomes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right at 307 Kay Street, in front of the house. Historic Hill. I rent there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 307 Kay Street, pothole in front of the house. And the tire blew when you hit it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Blew right out. And the rim is bent, so it's not just a tire. I'm looking at a wheel too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, bent rim. Got it. Did you get any pictures?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have photos. The hole, the tire, the rim, all of it. And it's a pothole, not a crack, just so we're clear. Your notes should say pothole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pothole, noted. I'll put that down. Do you have an email or a way to send the photos?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send them, sure. I just opened a credit union account last week, so I'm not exactly eager to spend money on a rim right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll log the report with the location and the damage, and I'll note you have photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does a repair usually take? Days? Weeks? Because this has been there a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it depends on the crew's list. In winter they get backed up, so it could be a few days to a couple weeks. I'll flag it as damaging a vehicle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple weeks. Wonderful. Okay, my number is 401-555-0187 if somebody wants to call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:00:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0187. Someone will follow up. Thanks, Mr. Gomes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks."
    }
  ],
